    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "The most fun &amp; challenging Clutter yet, with over 2100 puzzles to keep you playing for days and days.<br>So many new Clutter variations mixed in with old favorites for a Quest you'll never forget.<br>This is the first Collector's Edition with 25% more puzzles and additional bonus materials.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1776600/extras/df0f1501748fa16d691de49c4f5d02b5.poster.avif?t=1726773369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1776600/extras/df0f1501748fa16d691de49c4f5d02b5.webm?t=1726773369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1776600/extras/df0f1501748fa16d691de49c4f5d02b5.mp4?t=1726773369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>As always, the Clutter levels are highly addicting and replayable. In addition, there are Sliders, Square Jigsaws &amp; Box Quotes included. And wait until you see the Spirals, Singletons and Portals! You've never seen Clutter this fun &amp; challenging.<br><br><i>&quot;Hideously Addictive&quot;  <br>&quot;Best Game Ever&quot; <br>&quot;Can't Stop Playing&quot;</i><br><br>The options let you play Clutter the way you want. And Favorites are back so you can collect the puzzles you want to play again and again.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>New Object Sets &amp; Many New Gameplay Modes<br></li><li>Over 2100 levels and a very challenging 144 level Main Quest<br></li><li>A Bonus Old-School Classic Quest<br></li><li>Hundreds of picture puzzles and 288 new Box Quotes puzzles<br></li><li>Randomly generated levels mean endless replayability<br></li><li>All Music by the incomparable Mike Sal (Kix Kreative)</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "The most fun &amp; challenging Clutter yet, with over 2100 puzzles to keep you playing for days and days.<br>So many new Clutter variations mixed in with old favorites for a Quest you'll never forget.<br>This is the first Collector's Edition with 25% more puzzles and additional bonus materials.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1776600/extras/df0f1501748fa16d691de49c4f5d02b5.poster.avif?t=1726773369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1776600/extras/df0f1501748fa16d691de49c4f5d02b5.webm?t=1726773369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1776600/extras/df0f1501748fa16d691de49c4f5d02b5.mp4?t=1726773369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>As always, the Clutter levels are highly addicting and replayable. In addition, there are Sliders, Square Jigsaws &amp; Box Quotes included. And wait until you see the Spirals, Singletons and Portals! You've never seen Clutter this fun &amp; challenging.<br><br><i>&quot;Hideously Addictive&quot;  <br>&quot;Best Game Ever&quot; <br>&quot;Can't Stop Playing&quot;</i><br><br>The options let you play Clutter the way you want. And Favorites are back so you can collect the puzzles you want to play again and again.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>New Object Sets &amp; Many New Gameplay Modes<br></li><li>Over 2100 levels and a very challenging 144 level Main Quest<br></li><li>A Bonus Old-School Classic Quest<br></li><li>Hundreds of picture puzzles and 288 new Box Quotes puzzles<br></li><li>Randomly generated levels mean endless replayability<br></li><li>All Music by the incomparable Mike Sal (Kix Kreative)</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "By far, the most challenging and exciting Clutter ever. Every picture tells part of the story, and the story is of course, About Time!!! Clocks, Spirals &amp; Singletons are worth the price of admission. The very first Clutter Collector's Edition, so you know it's special. Good luck with the Portals!!!",
